WEBVTT

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:08.440
Everything is ready.

00:00:09.620 --> 00:00:10.650
Your Majesty.

00:00:13.180 --> 00:00:16.980
Planet Al Shahal

00:00:28.180 --> 00:00:30.640
Bio-fold waves rising.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:33.130
Now this is amazing.

00:00:35.640 --> 00:00:37.090
Anomalous brain wave activity detected in the civilians!

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:39.290
Delta waves confirmed.

00:00:44.170 --> 00:00:48.730
Delta waves normally only occur during deep sleep.

00:00:48.730 --> 00:00:52.750
In a sense, they are the brain 
waves that are closest to death.

00:00:54.530 --> 00:00:56.890
Fascinating, I must admit.

00:01:09.630 --> 00:01:14.990
<i>Our kiss will link us from one end to the other</i>

00:01:14.990 --> 00:01:19.420
<i>Our affection is too hot for mere passionate love</i>

00:01:19.420 --> 00:01:24.270
<i>We can be in absolute zero</i>

00:01:37.070 --> 00:01:39.070
<i>I'll spark a dream in you</i>

00:01:39.070 --> 00:01:43.590
<i>I'll embrace all you believe in</i>

00:01:43.590 --> 00:01:46.210
<i>Let your genes go wild</i>

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:53.090
<i>I love you so much, but I try to play it cool sometimes</i>

00:01:53.090 --> 00:01:56.940
<i>Tear off my mask and squeeze me to a whole new dimension</i>

00:01:57.720 --> 00:02:03.910
<i>Our cores crash into each other, confirming our uncovered love</i>

00:02:03.910 --> 00:02:08.310
<i>The tears we can't cry on our own connect us to the future</i>

00:02:09.770 --> 00:02:14.930
<i>Our passionate love will shoot us into a super nova-like state</i>

00:02:14.930 --> 00:02:20.820
<i>We can do this! No wounds can hold us back if we're together</i>

00:02:20.820 --> 00:02:23.540
<i>Charm me with your passion, pray to the heavens</i>

00:02:23.540 --> 00:02:26.910
<i>Our super big bang will breathe life into a new genesis</i>

00:02:26.910 --> 00:02:30.170
<i>We burn our lives for this fusion</i>

00:02:30.170 --> 00:02:35.650
<i>We are in absolute zero</i>

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:44.220
An emergency on Al Shahal?

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:46.700
The song of the wind was heard.

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:51.820
We hacked into a spy satellite and found that of the people who are still on the planet,

00:02:51.820 --> 00:02:53.690
over 85% are in a comatose state.

00:02:54.120 --> 00:02:59.150
The Windermereans appear to be conducting some sort of research on the unconscious civilians.

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:01.450
They're in a coma? So it's not Var?

00:03:01.790 --> 00:03:06.440
Bio-fold waves of unprecedented 
power have been recorded.

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:08.620
The rest is still a mystery though.

00:03:09.520 --> 00:03:13.550
So the song of the wind is now even more of a threat?

00:03:13.550 --> 00:03:16.110
What is Walküre going to do?

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:19.300
They've been locked up ever since they broke into the med ship.

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:22.300
They'll be back soon, right?

00:03:23.240 --> 00:03:25.260
That's up to Lady M.

00:03:26.410 --> 00:03:30.480
You do know we can't fight the song of the wind by ourselves, right?

00:03:30.750 --> 00:03:33.400
Command is well aware of that.

00:03:39.730 --> 00:03:41.850
I wanna take a bath...

00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:45.200
Rei-Rei, you have to eat up.

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:47.580
Tastes awful.

00:03:47.910 --> 00:03:50.540
I definitely understand...

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:57.050
The three of us eating terrible food reminds me of the old days.

00:03:57.050 --> 00:03:59.240
Yeah, brings back memories.

00:03:59.240 --> 00:04:02.210
When did you quit being an idol, Kana-Kana?

00:04:02.210 --> 00:04:03.180
Four years ago.

00:04:03.840 --> 00:04:06.780
You joined Chaos after that.

00:04:06.780 --> 00:04:08.890
You started off as our manager.

00:04:09.240 --> 00:04:12.890
Chaos had just started its music branch at the time.

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:15.750
There wasn't anything else I wanted to do either.

00:04:17.000 --> 00:04:20.100
2063 AD

00:04:21.750 --> 00:04:23.700
So you're from Planet Divide?

00:04:24.270 --> 00:04:27.410
I recall a rather protracted civil war on Divide.

00:04:27.410 --> 00:04:29.080
Any fighting skills?

00:04:29.080 --> 00:04:32.410
I learned self-defense when I was a child.

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:35.420
Have you ever seen actual combat?

00:04:35.420 --> 00:04:39.630
My city has had large-scale clashes a number of times.

00:04:39.630 --> 00:04:40.880
I see.

00:04:41.700 --> 00:04:47.570
In retrospect, I think they let me in 
because I knew what real war was like.

00:04:50.900 --> 00:04:53.290
A tactical sound unit?

00:04:53.290 --> 00:04:56.320
You've been briefed on fold receptors, I believe.

00:04:56.320 --> 00:04:56.900
Yes.

00:04:57.520 --> 00:05:01.490
We're gathering people who possess them in order to form a team.

00:05:01.490 --> 00:05:05.400
You will be in charge of their training and management.

00:05:05.760 --> 00:05:07.200
Understood.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.940
Who will be the members?

00:05:08.940 --> 00:05:10.200
We are still looking for them.

00:05:10.550 --> 00:05:15.330
First, we'll test every member of Chaos

00:05:15.330 --> 00:05:18.420
and see if there are any people with fold receptors.

00:05:19.460 --> 00:05:20.540
Then it turned out...

00:05:20.540 --> 00:05:23.130
I have fold receptors?

00:05:23.550 --> 00:05:27.590
We found another one in the 
intelligence department's IT team.

00:05:28.210 --> 00:05:30.800
She's been hacking into government and military facilities,

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:33.420
and various corporations all her life.

00:05:33.420 --> 00:05:35.270
A genius hacker of sorts.

00:05:35.910 --> 00:05:39.450
She was caught trying to breach into Chaos' servers.

00:05:39.450 --> 00:05:44.280
Instead of handing her over to the authorities, we got her on board.

00:05:44.890 --> 00:05:47.280
Her name's Reina Prowler.

00:05:47.280 --> 00:05:49.450
What were you even doing?

00:05:51.080 --> 00:05:52.450
Just fooling around.

00:05:52.680 --> 00:05:57.160
Kana-Kana, how come you didn't refuse when they asked you to join the unit?

00:05:57.870 --> 00:06:00.830
I didn't really give it much of a thought.

00:06:01.050 --> 00:06:04.590
The draw of being given another chance to sing was too strong.

00:06:04.930 --> 00:06:06.730
I feel you.

00:06:06.730 --> 00:06:10.810
I had no idea it'd be this tough.

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:12.550
I just heard there were auditions.

00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:17.810
Reina and I couldn't handle it by ourselves.

00:06:17.870 --> 00:06:22.520
2064 AD

00:06:18.380 --> 00:06:22.520
At the time, it still wasn't decided 
what kind of music we'd be doing.

00:06:23.780 --> 00:06:25.780
M-My name's Lily DuGrand.

00:06:26.390 --> 00:06:27.530
I'm Claire Puddle.

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:29.490
Makina Nakajima.

00:06:29.890 --> 00:06:32.270
At your service!

00:06:32.270 --> 00:06:34.740
Why did you say yes, Makina?

00:06:35.300 --> 00:06:38.830
They told you we weren't a typical idol group, right?

00:06:40.500 --> 00:06:44.760
You know me. I come from a family of mechanics.

00:06:44.760 --> 00:06:48.010
I've loved machines all my life.

00:06:48.010 --> 00:06:53.310
But as I grew up, I grew to love music as well.

00:06:53.310 --> 00:06:57.930
I felt that I could follow both 
my dreams at once if I joined.

00:06:58.660 --> 00:07:00.990
Or so I thought.

00:07:04.860 --> 00:07:06.860
What the hell's going on?!

00:07:08.570 --> 00:07:10.490
You can't stop here. Keep going.

00:07:37.780 --> 00:07:40.730
You two wouldn't stop fighting at first.

00:07:40.730 --> 00:07:43.690
That's cause Rei-Rei never did anything.

00:07:44.130 --> 00:07:46.440
I didn't care about singing.

00:07:47.610 --> 00:07:51.020
That was when Lily-Lily quit.

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:57.280
2065 AD

00:07:54.470 --> 00:07:57.280
We still got an offer with the four of us.

00:07:57.560 --> 00:08:00.450
And the name? What's our group's name?

00:08:00.750 --> 00:08:02.620
Tactical sound unit,

00:08:04.130 --> 00:08:05.420
Walküre.

00:08:06.180 --> 00:08:07.770
Walküre?

00:08:07.770 --> 00:08:10.120
Goddesses from Norse mythology.

00:08:10.120 --> 00:08:12.290
They guide the spirits of fallen warriors on the battlefield.

00:08:12.290 --> 00:08:14.090
Also known as the "valkyrie."

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:16.580
It's the same name as the VF-1!

00:08:17.390 --> 00:08:19.140
Now I'm fired up!

00:08:19.830 --> 00:08:21.170
Let's make it work!

00:08:23.040 --> 00:08:23.730
But...

00:08:29.650 --> 00:08:33.050
Our songs fell on deaf ears.

00:08:33.610 --> 00:08:36.370
We were deployed many times after that,

00:08:36.730 --> 00:08:39.080
but every sortie was a catastrophe.

00:08:58.050 --> 00:08:59.370
Are you okay?

00:09:06.320 --> 00:09:08.110
You're Kaname Buccaneer?

00:09:09.960 --> 00:09:11.570
Captain Arad?

00:09:13.160 --> 00:09:14.530
Co-op training?

00:09:14.530 --> 00:09:22.650
Yes. I think we need to practice together to get the best results from Walküre.

00:09:22.650 --> 00:09:26.500
We could do air shows during your gigs to get the audience excited.

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:29.100
Well, we'll figure something out.

00:09:29.100 --> 00:09:32.370
Jellyfish in a hurry end up washed up on the beach.

00:09:32.370 --> 00:09:33.760
Let's take our time to improve.

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:38.470
Definitely.

00:09:41.010 --> 00:09:45.390
Honestly, I was considering quitting at the time.

00:09:46.980 --> 00:09:50.300
I kept wondering why we had to go through all that stuff.

00:09:50.300 --> 00:09:53.570
It wasn't the idol life I had imagined.

00:09:54.980 --> 00:10:00.580
But Makina, remember when Lady M told us we'd be disbanded if our next show failed?

00:10:03.180 --> 00:10:07.210
Ta-da! Tactical sound unit Walküre!

00:10:08.580 --> 00:10:09.540
Are you okay?

00:10:09.540 --> 00:10:11.220
Let's wear this for our next show!

00:10:11.220 --> 00:10:14.510
Combat gear on stage won't get the audience excited!

00:10:14.510 --> 00:10:16.010
Is that really the issue?

00:10:16.010 --> 00:10:17.970
It is!

00:10:17.970 --> 00:10:20.890
I've already made one for everyone.

00:10:20.890 --> 00:10:21.600
Here.

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:22.300
And here.

00:10:22.810 --> 00:10:23.500
And there.

00:10:30.480 --> 00:10:35.900
<i>I reach and I reach till my fingers barely skim</i>

00:10:35.900 --> 00:10:40.570
<i>Hear me explode as I barely hold back my tears</i>

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:48.210
<i>Tears in my eyes</i>

00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:55.750
<i>Where is the future? Why can't I ever get there?</i>

00:10:55.750 --> 00:11:01.010
<i>I frantically look through the fading afterimage</i>

00:11:01.010 --> 00:11:06.040
<i>Bright lights fade out into frustrating cycles of death and rebirth,</i>

00:11:06.040 --> 00:11:11.310
<i>and nothing changes; it's impossible to escape</i>

00:11:10.020 --> 00:11:11.310
One, two!

00:11:11.650 --> 00:11:14.520
Tactical sound unit, Walküre!

00:11:20.940 --> 00:11:26.330
<i>Ah, I'm sorry. Ah, I'm sorry</i>

00:11:23.170 --> 00:11:25.880
We sortied many times after that.

00:11:26.330 --> 00:11:32.530
<i>The word "no" is at the tip of my tongue</i>

00:11:32.530 --> 00:11:33.120
<i>Cry</i>

00:11:33.120 --> 00:11:38.470
<i>I reach and I reach till my fingers barely skim</i>

00:11:36.190 --> 00:11:37.670
Who are you?

00:11:37.670 --> 00:11:41.070
We've taken him in.

00:11:38.470 --> 00:11:43.390
<i>I want to reach out to the end of the universe</i>

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:43.390
You saved me on Alfheim.

00:11:43.390 --> 00:11:48.700
<i>My heart beats so fast that it could explode any minute</i>

00:11:43.780 --> 00:11:45.790
I'm Second Lt. Messer Ihlefeld.

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:48.100
It is my pleasure.

00:11:48.700 --> 00:11:53.520
<i>Hear me explode as I barely hold back my tears</i>

00:11:49.690 --> 00:11:50.720
Likewise.

00:11:53.520 --> 00:11:59.290
Little by little, Walküre's fame grew across the galaxy.

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:01.750
I thought things were going well.

00:12:03.030 --> 00:12:03.960
But...

00:12:06.920 --> 00:12:10.700
Clai-Clai was at her limit.

00:12:11.440 --> 00:12:12.870
That was when she...

00:12:13.820 --> 00:12:17.220
Mikumo, appeared.

00:12:22.070 --> 00:12:24.890
When will the new recruit be here?

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:26.000
No idea.

00:12:26.000 --> 00:12:27.390
I wonder what she'll be like.

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:28.220
Me too.

00:12:28.460 --> 00:12:31.480
She didn't go through any auditions though, right?

00:12:31.710 --> 00:12:33.980
Contacts. Backroom influence.

00:12:44.520 --> 00:12:47.210
Are you our newest member?

00:12:50.210 --> 00:12:58.400
<i>You were always left behind,</i>

00:12:58.400 --> 00:13:07.680
<i>so you just watched from where you stood</i>

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:18.420
<i>Counting the sacrifices it takes to achieve something,</i>

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:14.100
She captured my heart.

00:13:14.950 --> 00:13:20.140
She was totally different from how I'd imagined artists or singers,

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:27.360
<i>you just stood there hiding your tears</i>

00:13:20.140 --> 00:13:25.590
but she was so overwhelming that I didn't even care.

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:35.620
<i>Your eyes are so sincere and pure,</i>

00:13:32.360 --> 00:13:34.970
Her voice hit home so hard it almost hurt.

00:13:34.970 --> 00:13:40.600
It was the first time a song reached so deep inside of me.

00:13:35.620 --> 00:13:46.590
<i>but you never saw this world that way</i>

00:13:46.590 --> 00:13:55.270
<i>Dreams aren't something you have by yourself</i>

00:13:51.610 --> 00:13:55.270
I realized right away that I was no match.

00:13:55.270 --> 00:14:04.410
<i>An invisible wind delivers them to you</i>

00:13:56.280 --> 00:13:58.690
Strangely, though, I didn't feel down at all.

00:13:59.480 --> 00:14:04.090
On the contrary, I felt determined to make Walküre the best group out there.

00:14:04.410 --> 00:14:13.080
<i>If you feel like you can fly high and far,</i>

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:07.900
I guess we did that.

00:14:08.540 --> 00:14:11.890
We became the best and greatest.

00:14:13.080 --> 00:14:23.080
<i>don't let go of my hand and hold it tight</i>

00:14:23.770 --> 00:14:24.590
Mikumo?

00:14:43.940 --> 00:14:45.110
White Knight, sir, what is the—

00:14:46.590 --> 00:14:47.520
Keith!

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:02.700
The ruins. The song of the wind. The Starwind sector.

00:15:02.700 --> 00:15:04.340
Every piece is in place.

00:15:05.380 --> 00:15:08.790
Is His Majesty's voice lacking something?

00:15:09.660 --> 00:15:12.990
Then there is Mikumo Guynemer.

00:15:12.990 --> 00:15:14.540
How did that woman pull it off?

00:15:22.200 --> 00:15:24.100
What's wrong, Keith?

00:15:24.570 --> 00:15:26.080
Why didn't you tell me?

00:15:26.080 --> 00:15:27.070
About what?

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:29.990
About His Majesty!

00:15:31.300 --> 00:15:35.030
I had Theo and Xao look into the doctor who you said left our service.

00:15:35.740 --> 00:15:36.990
Did you find him?

00:15:37.290 --> 00:15:40.110
Don't worry. I visited him alone.

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:43.980
He feared you'd kill him if he spoke.

00:15:44.570 --> 00:15:47.210
Then you've heard about King Gramia too.

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:47.920
I have.

00:15:48.770 --> 00:15:50.760
You killed him.

00:15:52.400 --> 00:15:55.820
The wound that killed him wasn't caused by an explosion.

00:15:55.820 --> 00:15:58.960
He was stabbed by someone.

00:15:58.960 --> 00:16:00.620
That's right.

00:16:01.180 --> 00:16:03.400
I extinguished his wind.

00:16:04.170 --> 00:16:05.400
You bastard!

00:16:06.090 --> 00:16:08.450
I stopped his suffering.

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:11.350
He would not have lived long.

00:16:11.350 --> 00:16:13.060
Why didn't you tell me?!

00:16:13.060 --> 00:16:14.650
To prevent confusion.

00:16:15.300 --> 00:16:18.580
I couldn't allow it to disturb His Majesty Heinz's heart.

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:21.830
What about King Gramia's last will then?

00:16:21.830 --> 00:16:23.580
Is that a lie too?

00:16:23.580 --> 00:16:25.080
It's not a lie!

00:16:25.600 --> 00:16:28.770
I could feel his thoughts through my rune.

00:16:29.820 --> 00:16:34.950
To achieve the peace His late Majesty wanted, 
defeating the UN Government is a necessity.

00:16:35.960 --> 00:16:37.840
And His Majesty Heinz?

00:16:37.840 --> 00:16:39.320
He accepted his situation.

00:16:39.320 --> 00:16:41.220
What else are you hiding?!

00:16:42.860 --> 00:16:44.520
That is all.

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:46.350
I have no secrets.

00:16:47.170 --> 00:16:51.150
Then why can't I feel anything from your rune?

00:16:51.150 --> 00:16:55.570
Do you not fly the same skies as me... As us?

00:16:56.600 --> 00:16:58.130
I'm sorry.

00:16:58.130 --> 00:17:01.470
But my love for the Fatherland is true.

00:17:01.470 --> 00:17:05.990
If you can't trust me, take the 
wind of my life here and now.

00:17:08.100 --> 00:17:12.260
Should you betray His Majesty, 
I will have no mercy on you.

00:17:21.100 --> 00:17:22.630
Keith...

00:17:22.630 --> 00:17:25.260
How I wish I could fly the same skies as you...

00:17:33.050 --> 00:17:35.240
Mikumo Guynemer...

00:17:35.490 --> 00:17:38.300
I figured she wasn't your average person.

00:17:38.300 --> 00:17:41.260
Did you tell the others about that?

00:17:41.260 --> 00:17:44.660
No. Lady M will handle that.

00:17:46.920 --> 00:17:48.920
What did you want to talk about?

00:17:49.250 --> 00:17:51.930
We'll infiltrate Windermere.

00:17:51.930 --> 00:17:52.340
What?

00:17:53.580 --> 00:17:58.910
We learned that Mikumo's singing 
can destroy the structures

00:17:58.910 --> 00:18:01.850
with no negative effects on the energy shaft or the local ecosystem.

00:18:02.150 --> 00:18:07.850
However, trying to free the occupied planets one by one won't get us anywhere.

00:18:08.420 --> 00:18:13.080
The core of the system that broadcasts the song of the wind across the galaxy

00:18:13.080 --> 00:18:14.970
should be somewhere on Windermere.

00:18:15.500 --> 00:18:17.280
We must take that out.

00:18:17.710 --> 00:18:20.340
Windermere's surrounded by the dimensional rift.

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:22.030
Getting there will be no easy task.

00:18:22.660 --> 00:18:26.040
They seem to have the technology to cruise through it just fine.

00:18:26.040 --> 00:18:31.000
The tech whizzes say it'll be possible as long as we hit a specific location.

00:18:31.730 --> 00:18:34.960
This is what brings us here...

00:18:37.670 --> 00:18:39.350
Alfheim?

00:18:40.090 --> 00:18:41.390
That planet...

00:18:42.170 --> 00:18:44.390
It's where I first met Messer.

00:18:47.530 --> 00:18:49.640
Are you okay now?

00:18:50.180 --> 00:18:52.510
Yeah. Sorry I made you worry.

00:18:53.050 --> 00:18:55.070
I heard you came to my rescue.

00:18:55.070 --> 00:18:58.240
You even broke into the med ship.

00:18:58.240 --> 00:19:00.140
We got caught though.

00:19:00.140 --> 00:19:01.490
It was a failure.

00:19:01.880 --> 00:19:03.410
What did you find?

00:19:04.850 --> 00:19:07.520
I figure Reina hacked them well.

00:19:07.520 --> 00:19:10.530
I doubt you got no intel out of it.

00:19:11.460 --> 00:19:13.920
I couldn't find anything.

00:19:16.020 --> 00:19:21.740
I heard that Lady M and HQ 
couldn't keep hiding it anymore.

00:19:23.620 --> 00:19:26.000
Now I know why I couldn't remember my past.

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:27.590
I even know my birthdate.

00:19:28.910 --> 00:19:34.220
Three years ago, August 17th, 2064.

00:19:34.220 --> 00:19:40.780
To combat the Var, I was created by 
implanting fold receptors into my cells.

00:19:40.780 --> 00:19:42.290
Mikumo...

00:19:42.290 --> 00:19:43.410
Stop that!

00:19:43.410 --> 00:19:44.780
You're you, Kumo-Kumo!

00:19:45.200 --> 00:19:48.040
Something was happening inside me.

00:19:48.040 --> 00:19:51.820
I had no idea what it was.

00:19:52.890 --> 00:19:55.790
But it was a really simple problem.

00:19:56.580 --> 00:20:02.260
They say my brain function was disrupted when I connected with the Wind Singer.

00:20:02.900 --> 00:20:04.740
That's fixed now though.

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:11.130
Apparently my senses are designed to be sharper than the average human's.

00:20:11.130 --> 00:20:11.780
That's why...

00:20:11.780 --> 00:20:12.810
Mikumo!

00:20:13.130 --> 00:20:14.300
I don't mind.

00:20:14.300 --> 00:20:16.420
I don't care if I'm a natural human or a clone.

00:20:17.610 --> 00:20:18.670
I will...

00:20:19.900 --> 00:20:21.380
keep singing.

00:20:21.820 --> 00:20:23.810
Mission 21: Yearning Secret

00:20:41.970 --> 00:20:47.010
<i>I stand on the burning wreckage</i>

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:53.730
<i>I don't know for how long or why at all</i>

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:58.490
<i>The flames around are drowning me</i>

00:20:58.490 --> 00:21:04.990
<i>Finding what I seek feels so pointless now</i>

00:21:04.990 --> 00:21:10.740
<i>Break the world and go beyond the ecstasy of the past</i>

00:21:10.740 --> 00:21:17.120
<i>Choose the future even if it's worse than the past</i>

00:21:17.130 --> 00:21:18.130
<i>Let's go</i>

00:21:18.130 --> 00:21:21.090
<i>Love forever until the very end</i>

00:21:21.090 --> 00:21:24.010
<i>Sing so hard until it hurts</i>

00:21:24.010 --> 00:21:29.800
<i>Until your soul finally settles down</i>

00:21:29.800 --> 00:21:32.710
<i>But if you still want to sing then</i>

00:21:32.710 --> 00:21:35.540
<i>If you want to bet all on living</i>

00:21:35.540 --> 00:21:41.360
<i>The purity of your heart will destroy everything</i>

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:46.310
<i>Ah, just remember this, baby</i>

00:21:46.310 --> 00:21:53.040
<i>You'll find forgiveness in a chaotic climax</i>

00:22:03.990 --> 00:22:04.960
What is it?

00:22:05.630 --> 00:22:10.180
During your experiment on Al Shahal, we gathered some fascinating data.

00:22:10.440 --> 00:22:12.330
The structures activated

00:22:12.330 --> 00:22:15.620
and the subjects' brainwaves 
synchronized on the delta level.

00:22:15.620 --> 00:22:18.290
It is as if they started forming some sort of a network.

00:22:18.290 --> 00:22:23.790
Calling this phenomenon mind 
control is derogative at best.

00:22:23.790 --> 00:22:29.610
It could be used to connect the minds of all mankind.

00:22:29.890 --> 00:22:33.210
Could it be that this was your goal all along?

00:22:33.210 --> 00:22:35.530
That's none of your business.

00:22:35.530 --> 00:22:38.440
Shut up and focus on the research you were paid for.

00:22:39.620 --> 00:22:42.180
I shall gladly do that.

00:22:43.820 --> 00:22:45.180
I must hurry.

00:22:49.160 --> 00:22:52.820
What is this wind?

00:23:04.540 --> 00:23:07.410
Rudanjal Rom Mayan...

00:23:31.560 --> 00:23:34.340
The Star Singer?!

00:23:36.810 --> 00:23:39.810
Next time: Extreme Brave
